30,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The bills are incredibly volatile; February is triple what August is. However, houses with fixed seasonal rates seem much more relaxed about using the heat.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The admin is a nightmare! Even with a template, you have to key in every single invoice. Other houses spend nearly an hour just logging readings.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It's not even close to fair. Some rooms use four times more power than others, and the north rooms get cold way earlier than the south ones.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Fitting meters is expensive—34,000 yen per room. Also, our payment log shows people are paying late because they're confused by the fluctuating amounts.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Minato,,People are actually avoiding using the cooler because they're afraid of the arguments. It took weeks just to figure out what the new people owed.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, if the usage gap is that huge, a flat split is definitely causing resentment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if people are already confused, adding more complex calculations will just make the monthly job even longer.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, exactly. It's not just about the money, but the physical difference in the rooms.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, but if we don't fix the underlying cost issue, the confusion and late payments will just continue.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Minato,,I just don't want us to keep fighting over the cooler or the move-in dates.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, is the electrician's quote a one-time fee or is there a recurring cost?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Minato, do you think a simpler system would stop the arguments, even if it's not perfectly ""fair""?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I think we need to acknowledge that some of us are effectively subsidizing others' heaters.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"There's a yearly check fee of 3,000 yen per meter. It's a significant upfront investment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think any system where we don't have to argue every month would be better.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
